  projectName: Axenado
  description: "A prototype exploring \nnon-linear, \nRPG-lite mechanics \nin a hypercasual
    \nmobile format. The \nplayer controls an \naxe cutting down \nrare trees for
    points, \nwith escalating tension \nas monkeys give chase \nand force a \nretreat
    to base. \n\n\nSimple progression hooks like levelling up showed genuine player
    engagement \u2014 though the \ndeforestation undertones were an unintended design
    note worth flagging."
